weakspot.client.combo.combodisplayenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show your hit streak (combo) on screen.\nCounted like the hit sound's scale: it breaks after about 2 seconds without a hit. Shown from 2.
weakspot.client.combo.comboscale.tooltip=[Client] Size multiplier of the combo number.
weakspot.client.combo.comboposition.tooltip=[Client] Where to show the combo.\nBELOW_CROSSHAIR, RIGHT_OF_CROSSHAIR, TOP_CENTER (below boss bars)
weakspot.client.combo.combomilestoneeffects.tooltip=[Client] Accent sound and glow when the combo reaches 10, 25, 50, 100, 250, 500 and 1000 (then every 1000).\nThe higher the step, the bigger the show (fireworks from 500, a title from 1000).
