weakspot.growth.dark=Too dark to grow (light %s, needs 9 or more). Light it up with torches (outdoors gets dark at night, too).
weakspot.growth.stuck=No growth after %s hits. Check its surroundings (water, light, space, soil).
weakspot.client.hud.blockhealthbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show the remaining health of the block you are mining as a green bar along the bottom margin of its face.\nOnly for blocks you mine by holding left click that can have a weak spot.
weakspot.client.hud.machineparticlesvisible.tooltip=[Client] Show the colored particles around boosted machines on your screen.\nTurns off the particles of your machines and of other players' machines alike.
weakspot.client.markers.weakspottrailenabled.tooltip=[Client] Animate weak spots as they move: the marker quickly slides to its new place, leaving a short trail.\nVisual only: hits count at the new place immediately. Off switches in place. Also applies to other players' markers.

key.weakspot.toggle=Toggle All Weak Spots
