weakspot.client.combo.otherscombodisplay.tooltip=[Client] Show nearby players' combos (10 or more) above their heads as "n HIT".
weakspot.client.combo.showothersmilestones.tooltip=[Client] Show a chat message when another player reaches a milestone\nWhen off, other players' milestones are not shown (your own milestone effects and chat still are)
weakspot.client.hud.machinebarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show progress (yellow) and fuel (orange) bars above furnaces, brewing stands and spawners.\nOnly while their machine weak spot is shown (sneak and hold right click with empty hands).
weakspot.client.hud.growthbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show a yellow growth bar at the foot of a crop while its weak spot is shown.\nOnly while you hold right click with an empty hand on it.
weakspot.client.markers.othermarkershape.tooltip=[Client] Shape of other players' weak spot markers.\nCIRCLE (filled), RING (hollow), DIAMOND, SQUARE. Your own marker stays a filled circle.
weakspot.client.markers.weakspotsenabled.tooltip=[Client] Turn your own weak spots on or off (the Toggle Weak Spots key switches it).\nWhile off, your weak spots do not appear and the game plays as usual. Other players' markers are still shown.
weakspot.client.markers.animalspotseethrough.tooltip=[Client] When your weak spot on an animal or enemy is hidden by its body, show the hidden part faintly through it.\nHelps when the body is bigger than the hitbox, such as chickens or zombie arms. Other players' markers are not shown through.
weakspot.client.hud.bowdrawbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] While drawing a bow, show how far it is drawn as a gauge below the crosshair.\nShown regardless of the bow weak spot and of turning weak spots off (HOME key).
weakspot.client.hud.vehicleboostbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show the remaining boost time (light blue) above the crosshair while your vehicle is boosted.

